<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HEART | Home personal </title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@flaticon/flaticon-uicons@3.3.1/css/all/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
        @media screen {
            footer {
                position: inherit;
                bottom: 5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-blue-950">
    <header class="bg-cyan-400 border border-b-zinc-200 flex flex-row justify-center w-full h-14">
        <nav class="flex items-center justify-between w-full p-3">
            <div class="img_logo"></div><!--img_logo-->

            <div class="w-60 h-full flex flex-row justify-center items-center">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full m-1 bg-red-500 border border-amber-300"></div><!--red_flag-->
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full m-1 bg-yellow-500 border border-orange-400"></div><!--yellow_flag-->
                <div
                    class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full m-1 bg-green-500 border border-purple-300 shadow-md shadow-emerald-400">
                </div><!--green_flag-->
                <div class="w-30 flex justify-end ">
                    <button
                        class="w-10 h-10 bg-zinc-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-white"
                        id="config"><i class="fi fi-ss-settings"></i></button>
                </div>

            </div><!--container_flags-->


        </nav><!--nav-->

    </header>
    <div class="w-[95%] p-3 flex flex-row bg-blue-300/30 m-auto items-start"><!--container---->


        <aside class="w-64 h-2/3 flex flex-1 m-3.5 border border-gray-500/80">
            <nav class="flex flex-1 flex-col bg-zinc-200 rounded-tl-full">
                <div class="h-[45%] w-full border-2 border-b-gray-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-between ">
                    <div class="foto"></div><!--foto-->
                    <div class="font-bold italic text-2xl mb-1 font-serif text-gray-700">
                        <span>
                            <%= user.name %>
                        </span>
                    </div><!--username-->
                </div><!--container_personal_info-->
                <div class="list_navigation">
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#">Perfil</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Portifolio</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Album fotografico</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Medalhas</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Regras de uso</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div><!--list_Navigation-->
            </nav><!--left_side-->
        </aside>
        <div class="flex flex-3 w-[80%] flex-col p-5 gap-7 items-center bg-cyan-400 mt-4 rounded-tr-4xl">
            <div class="w-full h-5">
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Bem vindo! </h1>
            </div> <!--Mensagem de Bem vindo-->
            <div
                class="w-[95%] h-60 bg-purple-950 rounded-tr-4xl rounded-bl-3xl flex flex-row overflow-scroll [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden items-center border-2 border-dashed border-black/5">

                <% for (let i=0; i < 10; i++) {%>
                    <div class="w-40 h-45 bg-amber-100 m-3 rounded-tr-3xl shrink-0 rounded-bl-2xl">
                    </div><!--lojas-->

                    <% } %>


            </div><!--contanier-port-->
            <div class="container_posts">

                <div class="w-full min-h-60 flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-300"><!--Criação de novo post-->
                    <form action="" method="post" class=" flex flex-col items-center w-full h-full">
                        <textarea name="" id="" class="border rounded-md border-gray-400 bg-amber-50 w-10/12 min-h-29 resize-none p-3.5"></textarea>
                        <div class="w-10/12 h-6 items-start p-1.5">
                            <button type="submit" class="border border-zinc-300 shadow shadow-black/50 hover:shadow-green-500/50 hover:bg-purple-400 hover:italic hover:font-bold hover:text-orange-200 active:bg-zinc-900 active:text-white w-20 h-7.5 rounded-md bg-emerald-300">Postar</button>
                        </div>
                        
                    </form>

                </div><!--Criação de novo post-->

                <% for (let i=0; i < 10; i++) { %>
                    <div class="post_elements">
                        <div class="post_foto"></div><!--post_foto-->



                        <div class="post_conteudo">
                            <div class="post_perfil">Nome da Empresa ou pessoa</div><!--post_perfil-->

                            Mussum Ipsum, cacilds vidis litro abertis.
                            Sapien in monti palavris qui num significa nadis i pareci latim.
                            In elementis mé pra quem é amistosis quis leo.
                            Suco de cevadiss, é um leite divinis, qui tem lupuliz, matis,
                            aguis e fermentis. Negão é teu passadis, eu sou faxa pretis.
                        </div><!--conteudo-->
                    </div><!--post_elements-->

                    <% } %>


            </div><!--container_posts-->
        </div><!--container_central-->
    </div><!--container---->
    <div class="clear"></div><!--clear-->

    <footer
        class="bg-cyan-400 w-[95%] text-center h-8 m-auto mt-1.5 p-1 items-center rounded-bl-2xl rounded-br-2xl shadow-lg shadow-purple-600 border border-t-gray-300">
        &copy; 2026 Direitos reservados Magnum Brouli
    </footer>
    </div><!--container-->
</body>

</html>